# Shell scripts and the extensionless hook context emitters run under bash on
# Windows (Git Bash / WSL). Force LF so a CRLF checkout never corrupts the `#!`
# shebang or `\r`-sensitive lines. Without this, git's autocrlf (often on by
# default on Windows) can rewrite them to CRLF and break the SessionStart hook.
*.sh                   text eol=lf
**/hooks/*             text eol=lf
**/lib/context/[0-9]*  text eol=lf

# Binary assets: never normalize line endings (protects them from the rules above).
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary
